+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, development builds included, and it is not turned off for local work. Local testing uses self-signed certificates rather than bypassing verification. Connections use https everywhere, with no plaintext exception, since certificate management is now in place.
